  <name>OpenAqua</name>
  <summary>Thermal management and telemetry suite for Aquacomputer devices</summary>
  <description>
    <p>OpenAqua is an open-source thermal management and telemetry suite designed for Aquacomputer hardware (OCTO, QUADRO, D5 NEXT, and compatible devices).</p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Autonomous Hardware Operation: Flash custom fan curves and profiles directly to onboard device EEPROM.</li>
      <li>Real-time telemetry monitoring for fan speeds, water flow, and thermal sensors.</li>
      <li>Virtual temperature sensor feeding from host metrics into hardware virtual sensor slots.</li>
      <li>Sensor calibration with custom temperature offsets.</li>
      <li>Native low-level USB HID interface with rootless udev support.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
